      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练中，千代王看着体育馆的方向，\r\n逐渐停下脚步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "894ad7a4be41bc653a5ccffb4e74b68a082437413d1754de74b9d551245cceb3",
