      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也将她视为『皋月赏』的强劲选手比较好吧。\r\n嗯～……不过，强者这么多……\r\n最强的种子选手会是谁呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6abecb4b3f1a1ed5a02d4ccf5f6094768b054809b59063cc8687e76cb98bd123",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
